cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use HAGISILTA in your research, please mention the software,
  version, and repository URL in Materials and Methods.
type: software
title: HAGISILTA
abstract: >-
  HAGISILTA is a DeepLabCut-based graphical interface for rodent video
  labeling, pose tracking, manual review, and behavioral analysis.
  The name stands for Human-Assisted Graphical Interface for Systematic
  Inspection, Labeling, Tracking, and Analysis.
authors:
  - family-names: Ok
    given-names: Seungwon
  - family-names: Song
    given-names: Jun-Hwi
repository-code: "https://github.com/hagisilta-dev/HAGISILTA"
version: "0.3.213"
date-released: "2026-11-03"
license: Apache-2.0
